{"id":"32221074998ee3fd","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-2sat.md","title":"2-SAT criterion and polynomial solvability","display":"thm-2sat — 2-SAT criterion and polynomial solvability","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-2sat","aliases":["27-thm-2sat"],"display":"thm-2sat — 2-SAT criterion and polynomial solvability","depends_on":["[[27-df-implgraph]]","[[27-df-encoding]]","[[27-df-classP]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§5.4.3 Theorem 5.4 and proof; §5.6.1","source_printed_pages":"213–214, 230–234","source_pdf_pages":"237–238, 254–258","verification_status":"source-statement-and-proof-checked-CNF-translation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-2sat"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-2sat</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-2sat — 2-SAT criterion and polynomial solvability"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7c550fd5ce4d17c6\" href=\"?note=7c550fd5ce4d17c6\" title=\"27-df-implgraph\">27-df-implgraph</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"42004383fb23d1fe\" href=\"?note=42004383fb23d1fe\" title=\"27-df-encoding\">27-df-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65c23d4db160ede7\" href=\"?note=65c23d4db160ede7\" title=\"27-df-classP\">27-df-classP</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§5.4.3 Theorem 5.4 and proof; §5.6.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"213–214, 230–234"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"237–238, 254–258"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-proof-checked-CNF-translation"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathrm{CNF}_n\">\\(C\\in\\mathrm{CNF}_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall K\\in C\\;(|\\mathrm{CLits}(K)|\\leq2)\">\\(\\forall K\\in C\\;(|\\mathrm{CLits}(K)|\\leq2)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_C,\\mathrm{Reach}_{E_C}\">\\(E_C,\\mathrm{Reach}_{E_C}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7c550fd5ce4d17c6\" href=\"?note=7c550fd5ce4d17c6\" title=\"27-df-implgraph\">27-df-implgraph</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{encCNF}\">\\(\\mathrm{encCNF}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"42004383fb23d1fe\" href=\"?note=42004383fb23d1fe\" title=\"27-df-encoding\">27-df-encoding</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf P\">\\(\\mathbf P\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"65c23d4db160ede7\" href=\"?note=65c23d4db160ede7\" title=\"27-df-classP\">27-df-classP</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EvalCNF}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{EvalCNF}_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"6b749704e82fc727\" href=\"?note=6b749704e82fc727\" title=\"27-df-cnf\">27-df-cnf</a>，在子句集上取合取求值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\left(\\exists a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(\\mathrm{EvalCNF}_n(C)(a)=1)\\right)\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;C_{\\emptyset}\\notin C\\land\\forall i\\in[n]\\;\\neg\\left(\\mathrm{Reach}_{E_C}(x_i,\\bar x_i)\\land\\mathrm{Reach}_{E_C}(\\bar x_i,x_i)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\left(\\exists a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(\\mathrm{EvalCNF}_n(C)(a)=1)\\right)\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;C_{\\emptyset}\\notin C\\land\\forall i\\in[n]\\;\\neg\\left(\\mathrm{Reach}_{E_C}(x_i,\\bar x_i)\\land\\mathrm{Reach}_{E_C}(\\bar x_i,x_i)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{2SAT}\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{encCNF}(m,F)\\mid m\\in\\mathbb N\\land F\\in\\mathrm{CNF}_m\\land\\forall K\\in F\\;(|\\mathrm{CLits}(K)|\\leq2)\\land\\exists a\\in\\mathbb B^m\\;(\\mathrm{EvalCNF}_m(F)(a)=1)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{2SAT}\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{encCNF}(m,F)\\mid m\\in\\mathbb N\\land F\\in\\mathrm{CNF}_m\\land\\forall K\\in F\\;(|\\mathrm{CLits}(K)|\\leq2)\\land\\exists a\\in\\mathbb B^m\\;(\\mathrm{EvalCNF}_m(F)(a)=1)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{2SAT}\\in\\mathbf P.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{2SAT}\\in\\mathbf P.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>一条有向边编码一个蕴含，解不能从真文字沿路径到假文字。互补文字同属强连通分量时矛盾；反向按凝聚 DAG 的互补分量逆拓扑成对赋值，得到满足赋值。单位子句由自对 {a,a} 正确编码，空子句由前置条件拒绝。图大小 O(n+|C|)，SCC 检查在线性图时间内完成；标准单带模拟仍为多项式。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-implgraph","status":"resolved","id":"7c550fd5ce4d17c6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-implgraph]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-encoding","status":"resolve